<title>ITALY: Italian Dec LIFFE future sets 128.58 record high.</title>
<headline>Italian Dec LIFFE future sets 128.58 record high.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Italian bond (BTP) December futures contract on LIFFE set another record high at 128.58 shortly after the start of trade.</p>
<p>The previous historic peak was 128.44, recorded in after-hours trading late on Tuesday.</p>
